      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:kbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx75nhouwc2g",
      "text": "This week's Substack: Kane James was mentioned as a breakout player for Exeter during pre-season. Has started hot, and here's why.\ntheofffieldreview.substack.com/p/kane-james...\nPlus notes on Gloucester, Sale, a missed chance for Newcastle, and Rees-Zammit being very much a wing.",
      "author": "Ben Coles",
      "handle": "bencoles.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:kbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/bafkreihnbnflj5pmzn2vw5tula7bf7hay7nsutvg5e7suz6y2bnoob5p2a",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/bencoles.bsky.social/post/3mx75nhouwc2g",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T09:48:33.413Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Akbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/bafkreif233f4dbiflmiulndyvoca6rylnwfgcakgqddxpvvmom24y42gwi/thumbnail.jpg",
      "source": "bencoles.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "youtube",
      "id": "yt:iSdaazlamf0",
      "title": "Una passione biancoverde senza confini 🤍💚",
      "author": "BenettonRugby",
      "avatar": null,
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iSdaazlamf0",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T09:19:46.000Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/iSdaazlamf0/hqdefault.jpg",
      "source": "UCZWp6Nb9Rk6w6Dz_O_2nHqw"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx5agusgmx2v",
      "text": "As we get ready to take on Cardiff at Laya Arena this Saturday, let's look back on our first game at the RDS 21 years ago 🏉\nHow many players can you name from the Leinster team who beat Cardiff that fateful October day in 2005? 🤔\nTry the quiz here 👉 https://bit.ly/4y4B8KB",
      "author": "Leinster Rugby",
      "handle": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreidewh6iscgzmp56acshzhwoixyjoxxld6vj6bi76zvuyirnaqf66y",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/leinsterrugby.bsky.social/post/3mx5agusgmx2v",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-05T15:33:13.909Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreifs2fkazuaxyxcjilpkg7ly36erpx3ys32j2rfchk6fvf2kgxhxmq",
      "source": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx4w7iixdu2q",
      "text": "🆕 Jamison Gibson-Park has returned to training while Max Deegan and Harry Byrne will be further assessed this week ahead of Saturday's clash with Cardiff at Laya Arena\n📰 Read the full injury report: https://bit.ly/4j4jL8X\n#LEIvCAR",
      "author": "Leinster Rugby",
      "handle": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreidewh6iscgzmp56acshzhwoixyjoxxld6vj6bi76zvuyirnaqf66y",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/leinsterrugby.bsky.social/post/3mx4w7iixdu2q",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-05T12:30:08.718Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreiecgq4beez2zdybuold4elfizbmrawvls3ggdz62lpdzhfcgz55k4",
      "source": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social"
